<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In BitMar: Low-Bit Multimodal Fusion with Episodic Memory for Edge Devices" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
